# env-templates.list
# One template file path per line (relative to project root).
# Lines starting with # are comments.
# Run: ./bin/env.sh substitute-all
#
# Format: path/to/file.ext.template
# Output: path/to/file.ext (same directory, .template extension dropped)
#
# Add new templates here -- no script changes needed.

